# Regexes for known-safe matches. Any flagged line matching one of these is dropped.
# Keep this list short and specific — each entry is a hole in the gate.

# PRIVACY.md / CLAUDE.md document the version rule using deliberately fake versions.
9\.9\.9
React 9\.9
SomeFramework
SomeDb 42\.0
SomeLang 7\.1
somedb:42\.0

# PRIVACY.md's enforcement section quotes the version-pin regex itself.
grep -rEn
